{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12126","headline":"送王季友赴洪州幕下 · 钱起","name":"送王季友赴洪州幕下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列郡皆用武，南征所从谁。\n诸侯重才畧，见子如琼枝。\n抚剑感知己，出门方远辞。\n烟波带幕府，海日生红旗。\n问我何功德，负恩留玉墀。\n销魂把别袂，媿尔酬明时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}